{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生\n埼玉県出身21歳の浅井恋乃未（あさいこのみ）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日発売\n「週刊少年チャンピオン」48号\n表紙・巻頭に掲載していただいています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "週刊少年チャンピオンさんに掲載していただくのは初めてです…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な機会を頂けてとても嬉しいです✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobMj4pCl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前髪があるよ〜^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobn424k8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobtQz0hU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "秋らしくもこもこベレー帽です🍂\n最近すっかり寒くなってきたからね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobyxj4ps.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もこもこパジャマでほっこり^_^♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鳥さんのぬいぐるみと写真を撮っていただいたり…🦜🦜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な写真をたくさん撮っていただいたので、ぜひチェックしてみてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#66"}], "source": "official"}